    <description>WGTA have been assisting FPL managers since 2017!

Join Tom (@whogottheassist on bluesky and YouTube; @WGTA_FPL on X) and Sam (@FPLPricey everywhere) for grown up FPL discussion, taking in stats, the latest trends and all of the big issues in fantasy football in a welcoming and friendly chat week to week - although we do nerd out a fair bit about the game!

Episodes out weekly, and streaming on YouTube Tuesday nights at 8:45! Our channel is whogottheassist.</description>
