    <item>
      <title>LFG!  | FPL Gameweek 1</title>
      <description>Sam &amp; Tom return after a week off, excited for the beginning of the #fantasypremierleague campaign for 2026/27!

On our final preseason pod, we discuss:

• Reaction to the final friendlies and Community Shield!

• Where we are with our current drafts heading towards the #fantasyfootball deadline

• Our chip plans

• 200 Club 2026/27 - who are our nominees?

• Ones to watch for the season ahead

• And our gameweek pod outline for the year ahead

THANKS SO MUCH FOR THE SUPPORT IN PRESEASON, we massively appreciated it.



If you enjoyed this, leave a 5-star review, say something nice if you’d like, and do subscribe to our feed – we really appreciate it, and it helps us so much!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
