    <item>
      <title>Drafts, Chip Plans And Simple Rules | FPL Preseason</title>
      <description>As we near the #fpl gameweek 1 deadline, Tom and Sam go through their current thinking in terms of drafts and also our tentative early chip plans.



We take a detailed look at our #fantasypremierleague picks as it stands, as well how our chip thinking dictates those.



Plus some simple rules we've put together to assist you to have a less rubbish #fantasyfootball season.



We’ll be back on Tuesday 18th (sorry, Tom off on a family holiday next week!) for our final pod of the preseason previewing Gameweek 1!


If you enjoyed this, leave a 5-star review, say something nice if you’d like, and do subscribe to our feed – we really appreciate it, and it helps us so much
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
