    <item>
      <title>Pricing The Tiddlers (Mid-Cheaper Players) | FPL Preseason</title>
      <description>Following our look at the expensive #fantasypremierleague assets last week, Tom &amp; Sam focus on the tiddlers - the mid price and cheap players - as we finish our frisk of the #fpl pricing.



On this pod:

•⁠  Edge pieces and their importance

- Goalkeepers 

- Defenders up to 5.0m

- Midfielders up to 7.0m

- Strikers up to 7.0m



Hopefully we’ll give you some insight on who to pick upon the cheaper players in the #fantasyfootball option set.



We’ll be back ON THURSDAY  at the usual time (8:45pm on YouTube, published shortly after on audio) for a chip and general advice pod due to Tom being on holiday next week.

Thanks so much for your support.



If you enjoyed this and you’re new to us, and if you’ve read this far, leave a 5-star review, say something nice if you’d like, and do subscribe to our feed – we really appreciate it, and it helps us so much!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
