    <item>
      <title>Pricing The Chonks (Expensive Players) | #FPL Preseason</title>
      <description>Welcome back assisters. 



Following our return on #fantasypremierleague 2026/27 launch day, Tom &amp; Sam begin the first of a pair of pricing pods, this time focusing in on the chonks – the more expensive players across the board.



On this pod:

-	Further comment on the pricing structure – has anything changed now we’ve played around with it a bit more?

-	Bruno/Haaland/Gabriel – who’s in? Who’s out?

-	Expensive Defenders 5.5m +

-	Expensive Mids 7.5m+

-	Expensive Forwards 7.5m+

-	Recent drafts



Hopefully we’ll give you some insight on who to pick upon the more pricey players in the #fantasyfootball option set.



We’ll be back next Tuesday at the usual time (8:45pm on YouTube, published shortly after on audio) to follow up with the Tiddlers (cheaper players).



Thanks so much for your support.



If you enjoyed this, leave a 5-star review, say something nice if you’d like, and do subscribe to our feed – we really appreciate it, and it helps us so much!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
