    <item>
      <title>Here We Go Again! | 26/27 #FPL Preseason</title>
      <description>WGTA IS 10!



Welcome back assisters. Tom &amp; Sam return on #fantasypremierleague 2026/27 launch day, dusting off their mics and shaking off the rust to kick off our 4 weeks of preseason fun and frolics before the Premier League officially kicks off in mid August.



On our first pod back, it’s mostly hot takes and vibes as we react to the game’s relaunch: 

-	What’s our view of the prices this year?

-	How have FPL done it, and do we like it?

-	What changes have been made to the game?

-	What are our views on this?

-	Any other watchouts?

-	Plus first drafts and preseason schedule



We’ll be back next Tuesday at the usual time (8:45pm on YouTube, published shortly after on audio) for the first of two pricing pods we’ll do this year.



Hope to see you again then, great to be back!



If you enjoyed this, leave a 5-star review, say something nice if you’d like, and do subscribe to our feed – we really appreciate it, and it helps us so much!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
