    <item>
      <title>Eagles Landing? | #FPL DGW36 (with Mo (FPL Trophy))</title>
      <description>Sam is joined by Mo in Tom's absence this week, as we delve into the final Double Gameweek of the #FPL season.

But the key question is, is it anything to actually get excited about? 

We preview DGW36, which (if any) Palace players are worth the punt for #fantasypremierleague managers, or are there some more appealing options outside of those with the Double. 

With chips left on the table, are we worried about the impact they'll have on our #fantasyfootball ranks this week?

Also the usual good stuff too, including One week punts, captaincy &amp; our transfer plans for the week ahead.

Like and subscribe to the show if you haven't already, it really helps us out and we massively appreciate it ❤️
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
