    <item>
      <title>Premium (Under?) Performance | #FPL GW35</title>
      <description>Sam &amp; Tom continue the meta discussions on a week where many WC32ers (we'll get to WC35, don't worry!) are set for gameweek, this time focusing on how #fantasypremierleague premium assets have perhaps failed to perform this year and if it's a one off or a start of a wider trend.

Then it's into previewing the weekend of #fantasyfootball, with WC35 picks and transfer targets analysed to understand what key points of difference may be for those on the alternative pathway.

Our regulars round off the show, including if Haaland versus a sometimes stubborn could be overlooked for the armband in favour of Bruno for the big clash with Liverpool at Old Trafford.

Sam will be back next week. Almost definitely not Tom!

If you enjoyed this, leave a 5-star review, say something nice if you’d like, and
do subscribe to our feed – we really appreciate it, and it helps us so much!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
