    <item>
      <title>Bye Bye BB? ~ FH Time! | BGW34</title>
      <description>As a - rather successful, thanks to Brighton defence! - #FPL bench boost week comes to its conclusion, Sam &amp; Tom are in to paradoxically figure out if it's time for #fantasypremierleague to sunset the chip in favour of a shakeup.

Press conferences also don't escape our scrutiny, as the lack of information regarding Joao Pedro sticks in the craw for many #fantasyfootball managers.

Then it's the regulars - one week punt, captain - to tidy up before we turn to the week ahead and Free Hit for those on the WC32 BB33 FH34 pathway. We reveal our draft(s), debate the possible routes of attack and also talk over what those not on Free Hit might wish to consider for the upcoming blank gameweek.

Sam (definitely) and Tom (maybe) will be back next Tuesday.

If you enjoyed this, leave a 5-star review, say something nice if you’d like, and do subscribe to our feed – we really appreciate it, and it helps us so much!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
