    <item>
      <title>Twin Doubles | #FPL DGW33</title>
      <description>Sam &amp; Tom return post wildcarding into near-identical teams to preview the #fantasypremierleague double gameweek 33 to come - the biggest of the year - to run the rule over our set teams as well as discuss free hit and alternative picks for those using other chips (FH, WC) or none at all going into the weekend.

Plus the usual one week punts and our #fantasyfootball captain for the weekend (erm, Haaland).

And, as it's a shorter pod with most teams actually quite set, we take time at the end for a lengthier, meta discussion on how we've ended up with a very set squad for the run-in, diagnose if it's a problem, and what FPL might do about it if indeed it's something that needs fixing.

If you enjoyed this, leave a 5-star review, say something nice if you’d like, and
do subscribe to our feed – we really appreciate it, and it helps us so much!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
