    <item>
      <title>Play Those Chips | #FPL GW32</title>
      <description>After a very long break, Sam &amp; Tom are back as we finally know the FA Cup semi finalists and therefore the identity of teams doubling in #fantasypremierleague DGW33 and blanking in BGW34.



We update on that, and run through some potential approaches you may take depending on your chip situation, with the main routes discussed. And how worried should you be if you've taken a route less travelled?



Plus, for quite a few, the wildcard has been activated. We take a look at our picks and figure out where - if any - there are points of debate which bundles in this week's form Vs fixtures.



Then it's one week punts and the academic matter of Bruno being your #fantasyfootball captain as it returns this weekend to round off the episode.



If you enjoyed this, leave a 5-star review, say something nice if you’d like, and do subscribe to our feed – we really appreciate it, and it helps us so much!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
