    <item>
      <title>The Season So Far | #FPL International Break (with Tom Campbell)</title>
      <description>WGTA are joined by special guest Tom Campbell for a more "zoomed out" episode as we lurch into a 3 week break from #fantasyfootball.

In this edition, we run the rule over the runners and riders for the fabled 200 Club, asking who might make it beyond the velvet ropes this year.

We also discuss our impressions of what's gone on with #fantasypremierleague generally this year. DefCons have changed the landscape - but how? And how has the changed environment affected manager's playstyle? Join us for some marmalade dropping findings.

Plus with many looking to wildcard soon we take a look at a possible draft - light touch though, as we really should be waiting until after the FA Cup results...

We'll be back on Tuesday 7th April.

If you enjoyed this, leave a 5-star review, say something nice if you’d like, and do subscribe to our feed – we really appreciate it, and it helps us so much!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
