    <item>
      <title>The Blank Is Nigh | #FPL BGW31</title>
      <description>Ahead of the much publicised blank 31, and also the beginning of the #fantasypremierleague end game for this season, Tom and Sam run through the possibilities for this week depending on where you are with your chips - with uncertainties (which we’ll mention) still hanging over one game still next weekend.



We caution against wildcarding immediately when the game reopens look at the #fantasyfootball transfers in this week, and figure out if it's just Bruno autocaptain.



