    <item>
      <title>Let's Get Back On Track | #FPL GW30</title>
      <description>Following the FA cup results Sam &amp; Tom are in to look figure out what the results mean for those all important #fantasypremierleague blanks and doubles given what we know so far.



Plus a quick look at how European turnarounds may affect the transfer decisions of many a #fantasyfootball manager ahead of the weekend. 



Additionally, with the upcoming blank gameweek 31 in our sights, we profile a few short term picks in form Vs fixtures, deliberate on who the best captain is as well as catching up with one week punts and where our teams are at currently.



