    <item>
      <title>Midweek Madness | #FPL Gameweek 29</title>
      <description>A Sunday night pod awaits for Tom &amp; Sam as the midweek #fantasypremierleague Gameweek 29 hares into view due to the FA Cup 5th round taking place next weekend.



Due to the rapid turnaround, on the agenda this time it’s a straightforward affair – and maybe a shorter edition – as our running order takes in our Gameweek 28 results, what our intentions are with doubts swirling over Erling Haaland’s fitness for midweek #fantasyfootball, a quick outlook on what we’ll learn next weekend, what players are attracting attention in form vs fixtures, one week puns, captaincy and then our plans for this midweek.



If you enjoyed this, leave a 5-star review, say something nice if you’d like, and
