    <item>
      <title>Gearing Up For The Blank | FPL Gameweek 28   </title>
      <description>Sam &amp; Tom are in to focus ahead again , as we build on last week's chat on the template shift to drill down into the key midfielder picks getting #fantasyfootball managers excited as the meta shifts again.

With a focus on gearing up for blank gameweek 31, which of these - over the next 4 - do we prefer as part and parcel of our #fantasypremierleague midfield makeup?

Plus in form vs fixtures, some defenders and forwards - and even goalkeeper - analysed, a contentious captaincy yet again, one week punts and our teams with one of us having already made their moves...
