    <item>
      <title>You Wanted Variety...? | #FPL GW27</title>
      <description>Sam &amp; Tom are in recording during the final game of #fantasypremierleague #dgw26, so cheering or wincing during the stream is likely!



We'll be looking ahead to #gw27, as many #fantasyfootball managers probably are after a below average double, and asking what shifts we've already seen to the template (causing the pain!) and anticipating how we'll start to gear up for the blank in 31.



Plus a small outline of the chip landscape - to be discussed in more detail next week! - our form Vs fixtures keying into that, and the usual regulars, including a potentially contentious captain decision this week should Haaland be ruled fit.



If you enjoyed this, leave a 5-star review, say something nice if you’d like, and
do subscribe to our feed – we really appreciate it, and it helps us so much!





