    <item>
      <title>Gabriel Triple Time? | #FPL DGW26</title>
      <description>Join Tom – and some voicenotes from Sam! – for a brief solo pod talking through how we did in 25 and some plans for #fantasypremierleague double gameweek 26.

With most of us set for Arsenal players, eyes turn to two follow up questions: do we triple captain Gabriel? And who else do we look at this #fantasyfootball gameweek?

Plus an update on one week punt and our plans for the week ahead.

Short one this time. We’ll be back WEDNESDAY WEEK.

