    <item>
      <title>Watching The Double | #FPL GW25</title>
      <description>Join Sam &amp; Tom, who'll be live as the second half of EFL semi final between Arsenal and Chelsea plays out behind them - telling us who of the two has a #fantasypremierleague double gameweek 26!

As a result, we'll try to leave off definitive chat as long as possible, instead focusing on our results from #fpl gameweek 25, a transfer window roundup, and a short chat about 50/50s and a refresher on how to navigate them best with Tom in particular suffering from 4 in a row backfiring.

Then it's the regulars: form Vs fixtures (as well as we can given the football), one week punts, captaincy picks and our teams.

If the game went late eg to pens, there may be a q + a and a live stream vibe as we wait for the result to be confirmed!

Like and subscribe to the channel if you haven't already 💜
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
