    <item>
      <title>Utter Carnage | #FPL GW24</title>
      <description>Sam and Tom are in slightly earlier (due to work commitments) for this week's WGTA, as we first off try to make sense of the mad events between 10:49-11:00am on Saturday morning after the leak that Haaland and Foden weren't starting for City.



We chat about what we did, how we felt and ultimately how that - thankfully, now rare - event can get the goat of even the most seasoned #fantasypremierleague managers.



And then it's on to the fixture swing that 24 begins, as we analyse the existing #fantasyfootball template, and chat through how we think the great runs many teams are about to embark on will see it transform.



Then it's a form Vs fixtures update, one week punts, captain choice (now back on the menu!) ahead of #GW24 and look at what we're doing with our teams.



If you enjoyed this, leave a 5-star review, say something nice if you’d like, and do subscribe to our feed – we really appreciate it, and it helps us so much!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
