    <item>
      <title>Back At It | #FPL Gameweek 21</title>
      <description>Happy new year! Tom &amp; Sam kick off WGTA 2026, returning after a couple of gameweeks within which Gabriel's return shook the #fantasyfootball template as we passed the halfway point in the season 🤯



This week, we're still in quick turnaround mode - catching up with all of the #fantasyfootball goings on we missed during our week off, picking out key men in Form Vs Fixtures to consider as we get out of the busy festive period, catching up on our one week punts, plus captaincy for the midweek gameweek 21 fixture list. 



And, one of us has been naughty and moved early - who's the traitor? Find out as we talk through our teams.



If you love our show and haven't yet, or you're new and loved what you saw, please like and subscribe to us 🙏🏻
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
