    <item>
      <title>New Year's Play | FPL Gameweeks 19 &amp; 20</title>
      <description>It's the final WGTA of 2025, coming to you on a Saturday night with Tom and Sam in the midst of a hectic #fantasypremierleague - and real life! - schedule 🤯🗓️



This week, we look ahead at the next two quick turnaround weeks and figure out how the template might move, if #fantasyfootball transfer targets coming into good fixtures like Man Utd and Newcastle assets are still worth it, and reiterate our tips on how to survive the rest of 2025 😅



Plus, a double helping of best captaincy and one week punts, as well as our planned machinations in our teams for the next little while 🔧



Happy new year from us! 🎆🎇

We'll be back on SUNDAY 4TH JANUARY.



If you enjoyed the show, give us a belated Christmas present and subscribe to our channel and give a 5* review. We'll forgive you for tardiness 🎁🙏🏻
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
