    <item>
      <title>A Red Christmas | Gameweek 18</title>
      <description>After an eventful weekend of triple captaincy successes (not ours), an emerging Christmas saviour in Ekitike aka Palindrome and a big injury for Bruno Fernandes, Tom &amp; Sam once more don our Christmas jumpers to try assess the fallout in our penultimate pod of 2025 ☃️



It's teams in red and players who might be in the red zone in focus this week, as we tackle both #fantasyfootball managers' conundrums: how to replace one player and buy another? And what will minutes look like for the teams over the mad period? 🔴



Plus the usual features as we figure out what our own transfers are going to be 🤯



We'll be back next SATURDAY for our final WGTA of 2025 due to holiday availability. See you then! 🎄



In the meantime, give us a Christmas present please #fantasypremierleague managers! 🙏🏻 and leave a 5* review subscribing to our feed 🎁
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
