    <item>
      <title>General Festive Fun (with FPL General) | #FPL Gameweek 17.mp3</title>
      <description>Sam &amp; Tom are joined by FPL General to preview both #fantasyfootball GW17 and the upcoming late December calendar in our annual festive edition! 



We discuss the mad schedule in the most wonderful time of year for #fantasyfootball managers, identify the kind of player we'd like Santa Claus to leave us in our stocking, talk player photos on previews, go through the Christmas shopping list in Form Vs Fixtures, talk Haaland driving our sleigh, and finally look at where our teams are for this week.



If you're new and enjoyed the show and for whatever reason are reading this, subscribe to the podcast 🫵🏻❣️!



We'll be back next MONDAY.
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
