    <item>
      <title>So Many Possibilities | FPL Gameweek 16</title>
      <description>Off the back of Bruno Fernandes magicking them a #fantasyfootball green arrow out of what was looking like a disaster, Sam and Tom are buoyed and in high spirits as we get given our 5FTs due to Afcon and wonder how to spend them 🤔



This episode, we take a look through the popular ins and outs in #fantasypremierleague transfers (e.g.g Bruno in, Mateta out) and analyse if they're moves with merit - and if we'll make them ourselves.



Plus even more players in form Vs fixtures, a one week punt update and is this finally the week we go against Haaland for ©?



If you like what you hear, please subscribe to us and, if you REALLY like what you hear, a 5* review goes a long way!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
