    <item>
      <title>Use It Or Lose It | FPL Gameweek 15</title>
      <description>Tom &amp; Sam reconvene midway through a #fantasyfootball gameweek to bring you another quick dip into the world of #fantasypremierleague as yet another deadline approaches.



This time, we focus on potential uses for managers’ FT(s) as we encounter a fairly unique “use it or lose it” situation with them as we reach the feted Afcon Free Transfer refresh, putting managers all up to 5FTs simultaneously. Do you take a short term punt, or grab someone for the longer term?



Plus best captains, a one week punt update and our team plans for GW15.



If you like what you hear, please drop us a subscribe and a 5* review!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
