      <title>Midweek Mission | #FPL Gameweek 14</title>
      <description>After an eventful weekend in #fantasyfootball, involving a triple captaincy mishap and Free Hit seemingly ruling the roost, Sam &amp; Tom are in for a pared down show previewing the midweek set of fixtures.



Including a word on the unique situation we're in with transfers, form Vs fixtures, captaincy call and our own dilemmas due to a suspension or two, we'll tell you everything you might need to know as the Tuesday #fantasypremierleague deadline approaches fast!


