      <description>After rather successful weeks for once, Tom and Sam look ahead to GW13 with plenty of chips being played by #fantasypremierleague managers.

We look at free hits on the table and try to figure out balance vs. aggression, check out wildcards and discuss the merits of TCing the #fantasyfootball robot.

Plus lots of short and long term picks in form Vs fixtures, one week punt and what we're doing with our teams.

