    <item>
      <title>The Restart Flag | FPL Gameweek 12</title>
      <description>It's time once more to think about #fantasypremierleague as the final international break of 2025 ends with a few notable players now in doubt for GW12! 



Sam &amp; Tom look over the news from the break and ask if and how #fantasyfootball managers should react, especially as, ironically, a couple of those flagged in Semenyo and Gabriel form core parts of this year's template.



Then form Vs fixture looks at picks for the congested period on the horizon, it's getting closer in the one week punts and could it finally be the week to go against perma-captain Haaland?



Plus if our thinking around our sides has changed from last week's initial first thoughts.



Like and subscribe to the show 🫵🏻❤️
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
