    <item>
      <title>Time To Attack? | FPL Gameweek 11</title>
      <description>With the 5 Free Transfers we get in GW16 on the horizon, Sam &amp; Tom ask if it's time for #fantasypremierleague managers to be more aggressive and go shorter term with their picks 🥊



Plus a lot of faces in form Vs fixtures suiting that idea, one week punt updates and a look at best © this week when the Man City Vs Liverpool game may mean we look elsewhere...? 🤖🆚❓



And then in our teams, does Sam deploy his #fantasyfootball bench boost this week and is Tom really buying João Pedro *back?



If you enjoyed this, leave a 5-star review, say something nice if you’d like, and do subscribe to our feed – we really appreciate it, and it helps us so much!
