    <item>
      <title>Proactivity vs Patience | FPL Gameweek 10</title>
      <description>Patience Vs Proactivity | #FPL GW10



Tom and Sam discuss the value of holding onto your faltering #fantasypremierleague assets versus acting to remove them this week, as the season reaches double figures.



Plus a lot of new assets added to the form Vs fixtures grid, one week punts and the best #fantasyfootball captain this weekend!



And the main topic feeds into our teams, with some stick or twist dilemmas we're both trying to grapple with.



