    <item>
      <title>Back To Basics | Gameweek 8</title>
      <description>Normal service resumes as FPL returns this weekend!

Following our in-depth look at analytics and this season last week with Si Analytic (do go check that out ICYMI!), today Tom &amp; Sam go into the Gameweek 8 preview.

We cover any news during a quiet international break and any potential ramifications for managers been.

And then it’s onto form vs fixtures, with several picks under the microscope including big Nick Woltemade and those from swing teams Chelsea, West Ham and Leeds, a one week punt update and a cursory nod to any captaincy debate.

But really, we’re all just here because Sam’s on his wildcard and we want to see what he’s cooked up, so we spend much more time on that at the end!

If you enjoyed this, leave a 5-star review, say something nice if you’d like, and do subscribe to our feed – we really appreciate it, and it helps us so much!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
