    <item>
      <title>Analytick Boxes | FPL IB 2 with Simon FPL Analytic</title>
      <description>Analytick Boxes | FPL IB 2 with Simon FPL Analytic



Continuing our series of international break guest episodes, this time Simon is back to join Sam &amp; Tom to cast his analytical lens over a few areas topping FPL managers’ agendas this season.



Covering thoughts some key men’s rise and fall, defcons, the next bloc of 4 games and Sam’s now active wildcard, it’s a nice relaxed international break chat as we enter a weekend without fantasy football.



Back again next Tuesday for our GW8 preview.



