    <item>
      <title>Chips Away | FPL Gameweek 6</title>
      <description>Tom’s pressed the button after a all-time bad start, and Sam’s probably triple captaining Haaland. So it’s an interesting week for us on the pod, with our #fantasyfootball futures in the balance as we play around with our chips and – especially in one of our cases – try to start again.



We look through all the options for chips, and explain why we’re taking the paths we’ve chosen: will it work for you? Check out the show and see.



Plus a real mix of unusual characters in form vs fixtures, reflecting the unorthodox assets thrown up by the start of the season, our one week punt picks for gameweek 6 and also a (non?) discussion on captaincy.



And Tom’s wildcard team revealed.



If you enjoyed this, leave a 5-star review and subscribe to our feed – we really appreciate it, and it helps us so much!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 23 Sep 2025 22:50:00 -0000</pubDate>
      <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
