Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</itunes:summary>
      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Tom’s pressed the button after a all-time bad start, and Sam’s probably triple captaining Haaland. So it’s an interesting week for us on the pod, with our #fantasyfootball futures in the balance as we play around with our chips and – especially in one of our cases – try to start again.</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>We look through all the options for chips, and explain why we’re taking the paths we’ve chosen: will it work for you? Check out the show and see.</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Plus a real mix of unusual characters in form vs fixtures, reflecting the unorthodox assets thrown up by the start of the season, our one week punt picks for gameweek 6 and also a (non?) discussion on captaincy.</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>And Tom’s wildcard team revealed.</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>If you enjoyed this, leave a 5-star review and subscribe to our feed – we really appreciate it, and it helps us so much!</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
      </content:encoded>
      <itunes:duration>5213</itunes:duration>
      <guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[a631ce68-98cf-11f0-951b-e7cccd6de9ac]]></guid>
      <enclosure url="https://pscrb.fm/rss/p/traffic.megaphone.fm/COMG6261782817.mp3" length="0" type="audio/mpeg"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>The New Meta? | Gameweek 5</title>
      <description>Join Tom &amp; Sam to discuss if the tectonic plates of #fantasypremierleague have shifted. Is Haaland the new king? Do we fade Mo? Are Villa and Forest now villains? And is DefCon fuelled big at the back sustainable?

Plus many players under the microscope in form Vs fixtures, one week punt update and perhaps a shorter captaincy calls chat this round.

Whether you’re new to us or returning this year, please leave a 5-star review and subscribe to our feed!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
