    <item>
      <title>A Perfect Storm(?) - Gameweek 4</title>
      <description>As a return to Premier League action gallops into view, Sam’s back on the pod to assist Tom in this week’s preview of Gameweek 4.



And it’s an interesting one, with transfer window deals potentially shaking things up, injuries and managerial changes around the place, and, for some fantasy football managers, buttons being pressed when it comes to Wildcards and Free Hits.



We’ll discuss all of that, as well as running through a few key players in form vs fixtures catching the eye, provide a one week punt update and discuss best captains before revealing our setups for this week – have either of us pressed a button?



Whether you’re new to us or returning this year, please leave a 5-star review and subscribe to our feed!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
