    <item>
      <title>Catching Up With Nick | #FPL Gameweek 4</title>
      <description>We’re in for a Sunday night edition this week and this time – as we’re in international break, Sam’s on holiday and Tom’s about to go too – Tom take the opportunity to catch up with the very first WGTA cohost, Nick!



We haven’t got much of an agenda in this fireside chat which mostly covers discussion on how FPL has evolved in the 9+ years since we founded WGTA, how our games have changed (especially with the advent of algorithmic, analytical FPL) and observations about how the game may continue to grow. Plus a bit of chatter about how we’re doing this season.



Normal service is resumed Tuesday 9th.



Whether you’re new to us or returning this year, please leave a 5-star review and subscribe to our feed!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
