    <item>
      <title>A Torrid Start | Gameweek 3</title>
      <description>It’s not been the best start for us. But why? Time for a quick examination to see if we’ve just been plain unlucky or if we feel like we’ve got it totally wrong as the early couple of weeks bring nothing but below average scoring to kick off this week’s show.

Then, it’s onto form vs fixtures: are we losing faith too soon in some, while jumping onto others when they could merely be a flash in the pan?

Plus the one week punt update and a discussion on captaincy where this week seems an uncertain, split pin week.

Whether you’re new to us or returning this year, please leave a 5-star review and subscribe to our feed!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
