    <item>
      <title>Licking Our Wounds | Gameweek 2</title>
      <description>After a rather lackluster opening weekend, we’re glad to be given the chance to talk out our various grievances this week as a lot of sliding doors moments deprive us of a fire start.

 

In form vs fixture, we look at the three key risers this week – Reijnders, Semenyo and Wood – to ask if the early reactions merit an early purchase, plus look at other options out there given what we’ve seen… knowing it’s just been one week.

 

Also an update on the one week punt and also best captain for the week ahead, before we spend time analysing potential moves for our own sides.


Whether you’re new to us or returning this year, please leave a 5-star review and subscribe to our feed!












Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
