    <item>
      <title>Here We Land | Gameweek 1</title>
      <description>In our final preseason pod, we take in the final friendlies and community shield to see what we've learned - and what outstanding questions we're hoping get answered in the time left.

Then we update on the pod this year - how we're approaching it, and start the One Pick Punt competition as well as making our season long Bold Claims.

 Finally - our teams. Obviously there's still time to go, but we'll run through what's changed and why from the extra pod last week and how we're likely to set up ahead of the deadline - and this start of the 25/26 campaign.

Whether you’re new to us or returning this year, please leave a 5-star review and subscribe to our feed!


Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
