      <title>Psychology Behind FPL (with  @FPLRaptor ) - FPL Preseason</title>
      <description>Sam &amp; Tom are joined by the brilliant FPL Raptor (Ross) as part of our preseason content to discuss some of the psychological pitfalls us FPL managers face during the season – and how to tackle them.

We work through 5 key areas taking in many biases and heuristics on our journey, which hopefully will assist you in not falling into these traps throughout the 25/26 season – and beyond!

