    <item>
      <title>We Are So Back | FPL Preseason</title>
      <description>Sam &amp; Tom are back, coming in hot on launch day as WGTA returns for year NINE (wtaf!)

This episode, we react to the prices and talk through some early takes on what we’ve spotted as we’ve hunted through the list.

We give our views on the changes to the game this year, covering defensive contributions (defcons, of course), double chips, the contentious afcon transfer refreshing and the bonus tweaks to ask why FPL towers decided to put these in place.

Plus we reveal some very early drafts given all we’ve spoken about.

Whether you’re new to us or returning this year, please consider leaving a subscribe to our feed and 5-star review  if you enjoyed the pod!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
      <pubDate>Mon, 21 Jul 2025 21:18:00 -0000</pubDate>
      <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
      <itunes:author>Who Got The Assist?</itunes:author>
      <itunes:subtitle></itunes:subtitle>
      <itunes:summary>Sam &amp; Tom are back, coming in hot on launch day as WGTA returns for year NINE (wtaf!)

This episode, we react to the prices and talk through some early takes on what we’ve spotted as we’ve hunted through the list.

We give our views on the changes to the game this year, covering defensive contributions (defcons, of course), double chips, the contentious afcon transfer refreshing and the bonus tweaks to ask why FPL towers decided to put these in place.

Plus we reveal some very early drafts given all we’ve spoken about.

Whether you’re new to us or returning this year, please consider leaving a subscribe to our feed and 5-star review  if you enjoyed the pod!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</itunes:summary>
