    <item>
      <title>Chaos vs Control | Gameweek 38</title>
      <description>In our penultimate pod of the season, Sam &amp; Tom debate whether we should lean into the games with something on the line or those without any real meaning in order to spike some high scores on what’s always a goal-friendly final gameweek! 

Plus a rundown of past last days to see how many goals are normally scored, a final bold claims and a captaincy decision that may run right down to the wire.

We’ll be back next week for our season finale, but if this is your last pod – thanks so much for your support this campaign &lt;3 

And, if you have enjoyed our content this year and haven’t already, subscribe to the feed and leave a 5* review – it means so much to us!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
