    <item>
      <title>Boom Or Bust | Gameweek 37</title>
      <description>With just two gameweeks remaining, Sam &amp;
Tom consider what's realistic for FPL managers looking to finish the season with a bang as time runs short ⌛

We look at some key differential you could roll the dice on to hopefully end the season on a high 🎲

 

Plus in the preview, lots of transfer activity, best captains and ANOTHER point in scored in bold claims 🥳

 

We're coming to the end of the campaign, so if you've enjoyed the show and haven't done so yet, we'd massively appreciate if you’d subscribe and leave a 5* review of the pod – it goes a long way
