    <item>
      <title>Trolling About | FPL Gameweek 36</title>
      <description>This time, join Sam &amp; Tom on a pod spent
- half tongue in cheek! - reflecting on what an "FPL Troll" actually
is with many nominations flying around on social media after a difficult
weekend for many managers.

 

Plus in our gameweek 36 preview, lots of
movement in the transfer market as people move on from Palace players and
captain, again, is arguably another open question.

 

We're coming to the end of the campaign, so
if you've enjoyed the show and haven't done so yet, we'd massively appreciate
if you’d subscribe and leave a 5* review of the pod – it goes a long way















