    <item>
      <title>FPL's A Beach | Gameweek 35</title>
      <description>Sam and a sad Tom return after Free Hitters leave chipless managers in the dust following a wildly successful weekend for many.

 

This time round, we preview the end of the season, looking through the roster of Premier League teams to try to work out how motivated they are for the rest of the year through analysing their "beachiness". We do this by asking: what do they have left to play for?



Plus the GW35 preview, including a pretty open captaincy conundrum this weekend.



If you liked the show, please subscribe and leave a 5* review of the pod – it goes a long way!


Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
