    <item>
      <title>Your Free Hit Tool Kit | Blank Gameweek 34</title>
      <description>As the biggest double gameweek of the season comes to its close (live on the pod!), Sam &amp; Tom look ahead to blank gameweek 34 – the moment at which many FPL managers are deploying their Free Hit chip to deal with the absence of many of their players. We supply our “Free Hit Kit” to help you to navigate the picks for the week ahead.
 
Plus the Gameweek 34 preview returns to its true form, with the knee jerk assisting managers who are not on the free hit (like Tom), best captains, best transfers in and another point on the board in bold claims!
 
If you liked the show, please subscribe and leave a 5* review of the pod – it goes a long way
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
