    <item>
      <title>Double Down! | Double Gameweek 33</title>
      <description>Tom &amp; Sam are in a sombre mood this week after a spectacular gut punch on bench boost in double gameweek 32. It's a space for introspection and healing here: where did it all go wrong!?
 
Then, it's onto regularly scheduled programming via our double gameweek 33 preview - key players, best transfers, chip talk, captains and bold claims - as we try to get back on track. Featuring a potential surprise pivot from one of us...
 
If you liked the show, please subscribe and leave a 5* review of the pod – it goes a long way

