    <item>
      <title>Double Up | Double Gameweek 32 </title>
      <description>Tom &amp; Sam preview the first of a pair of upcoming double gameweeks in FPL - the crowning glory of fantasy in most seasons.
 
In the show this week, we discuss the debate between the pair - which week is the best to bench boost? And, if you have your triple captain left, do you triple captain for the other?
We also - for those on AM especially - pop through a few differentials you might wish to consider for the week ahead. We're chiefly focused on single gameweek picks as we imagine the majority are set for their Palace &amp; Newcastle.
 
Plus other transfer manoeuvrings, a POINT SCORED IN BOLD CLAIMS, a word (literally) on captaincy and our teams for DGW32.
 
If you liked the show, please subscribe and leave a 5* review of the pod – it goes a long way
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 08 Apr 2025 21:47:00 -0000</pubDate>
