    <item>
      <title>What Wood You Do? | Gameweek 30</title>
      <description> After a bit of a break, Tom &amp; Sam are podding again to preview Gameweek 30!
 
A lot’s happened the gap between pods, with international break injuries (hello Christopher Walter Wood) and FA Cup results giving us a clearer picture of the upcoming doubles and blanks.
 
And then a Haaland injury happened, and things went berserk.
 
We discuss this in our GW30 preview, taking in the calendar update, reactions to injuries (should wildcards be wielded?) and best transfers &amp; captains for the midweek games.

And do we wildcard? Well, it looks like we both might...
 
If you liked the show, please subscribe and leave a 5* review of the pod – it goes a long way
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
