    <item>
      <title>Drawing A Blank | Blank Gameweek 29</title>
      <description>Sam &amp; Tom are in to preview the upcoming blank gameweek in FPL.

But we start off with a tribute to the FPL 🐐 Mo Salah.
 
And then we see what course managers are taking to navigate this challenge, by suggesting possible free hit teams and using that as a springboard to discuss approaches and potential differentials ahead of the blank week. 

Plus the big Haaland vs Wood captain debate.
 
If you liked the show, please subscribe and leave a 5* review of the pod – it goes a long way
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
