    <item>
      <title>It Means More Worries! | Gameweek 28</title>
      <description>Tom &amp; Sam return after a weekend off to discuss its aftermath, as events have conspired to mean the "forgotten" Gameweek 28 now contains many decisions for FPL managers - particularly in the forwards. Turns out, Cunha/Mateta means more worries...
 
Plus an update on the calendar projections and chips following that FA cup weekend, a discussion on if you should triple captain Salah this week, and our plans.
 
If you liked the show, please subscribe and leave a 5* review of the pod – it goes a long way
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
