    <item>
      <title>AMming and Aahing | Double Gameweek 25</title>
      <description>DGW25: AMming and Aahing 💭
 
More chip chat! Now we know the Carabao cup finalists, we're able to discuss more about ongoing strategy in our fantasy premier league teams as we reach the business end of the season 🍟
 
Plus, we preview double gameweek 25, debating if we're going deep on doublers or looking ahead to 29 as well as figuring out which Assistant Manager we may be swapping in for Moyes 👔
 
If you liked the show, please leave a 5* review and subscribe - it really helps get us out there 💜
