    <item>
      <title>Panic Stations! | Double Gameweek 25</title>
      <description>This week, we’ve got an interim Gameweek pod as DGW24 stretches through two sets of vitally important fixtures for FPL managers – the next FA Cup round and the Carabao Cup semi finals.
 
Tom &amp; Sam assess the wreckage after many managers veered suddenly off course due to the Friday chaos grenade that Gameweek 25 was suddenly a double gameweek, and look at how the rest of the calendar now, probably, is shaping up.
 
Plus – the Vanilla Awards for 2024/5! As we head into chip season, we look back at the season thus far and analyse how teams and players have performed in the part of the season prior to everything going wild.
 
If you liked the show, please subscribe and leave a 5* review, it really helps get us out there 💜
 
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
