    <item>
      <title>Double Vision | Double Gameweek 24</title>
      <description>We focus squarely on the upcoming double this week, as Sam &amp; Tom spend time poring over the options and ask: how many eggs are we putting into this particular double gameweek basket? 🪺
 
Plus, as our main section is the preview, we'll talk more widely about upcoming weeks towards the end - in particular, any further ideas for the GW25-8 period before the upcoming blank in 29 and any other business 🤝
 
If you liked the show, please subscribe and leave a 5* review: it really helps get us out there 💜
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
