    <item>
      <title>The Wood Through The Trees | Gameweek 22</title>
      <description>Following an eventful FA Cup weekend break for the Premier League, FPL came back with a vengeance in midweek. Due to the quick turnaround between Gameweeks, Tom &amp; Sam focus squarely on the preview for the weekend on the show today.
 
On the menu today, we ponder the wisdom of holding a misfiring player who might have good underlying numbers (aka Nico Jackson) versus selling off for an overperforming on (aka Chris Wood), and the usual other features in terms of best transfers and best captains for the weekend ahead, plus update on bold claims.
 
If you liked the show, please subscribe to the pod - it really helps get us out there 💜
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
