    <item>
      <title>Getting Effectively Owned | Gameweek 21</title>
      <description>The frantic festive period in fantasy football came to an end this weekend with a typically rollercoaster final week. Tom &amp; Sam are back to assess the outcomes and look ahead to the business end of the season in our new Tuesday slot!
 
This time, we zero in on the specter haunting FPL managers week to week: effective ownership. We ask: how does it affect our gameplay at different times, and indeed whether we should pay any attention to it at all?
 
Plus in the Gameweek ahead previews, there’s lots of information to come with cup ties galore before the next Premier League matchday but there’s still the usual roster of the Kneejerk (this week: do we back our horses or chop and change in the edge piece positions?), best transfers, bold claims and, finally, a bit of actual discussion in best captains this time around.
 
If you liked the show, please subscribe to the pod and leave a 5* review -  it really helps get us out there 💜
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
