    <item>
      <title>New Year, New Fortunes | Gameweek 20</title>
      <description>Happy new year and welcome to WGTA 2025!
 
Sam &amp; Tom start the year with the festive fixture run nearing its conclusion, with a show on new year’s day!
 
This week, with Mo Salah smashing through the 200 Club barrier in record time, we take a moment to bow down to the Egyptian king while also spending time nominating who else of the current crop of FPL players we’d back to join the Liverpool talisman beyond 200 points this season.
 
Plus we look ahead to the final weekend of the frantic festive fantasy football period, discussing Forest in the kneejerk, other top transfers and our bold claims. And best captain summed up in one word. 

Then it's onto this week's teams, and a bit of an advice clinic for Tom as Doctor Sam looks at the options available!
 
Please subscribe to the pod and leave a 5* review if you enjoyed the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
