      <title>Unboxing FPL Points | Gameweek 18</title>
      <description>This week, Tom and Sam preview the Boxing Day fixtures amid a tumultuous weekend in Gameweek 17, which kicked off the festive feast of FPL.
 
We discuss Saka replacements – or do you just hold on? – in the kneejerk, take the temperature on other moves fantasy managers are making in Best Transfers, goals galore are predicted in Bold Claims and we ask if anyone can stand against the Egyptian juggernaut for our captaincy pick?
 
Please subscribe to the pod and leave a 5* review if you enjoyed the show!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
