    <item>
      <title>Stormy Seas | Gameweek 16</title>
      <description>Tom &amp; Sam take a breath after a hectic 3 gameweeks in 7 days to think about the state of the fantasy football game at the moment. As things get rather template, we ask: where can we differentiate?
 
Plus a look at FPL GW16 in our gameweek preview, as we discuss defensive woes in the Kneejerk once more and also try to figure out which of Salah or Palmer should get the armband this week!
 
Subscribe and leave a 5* review if you enjoyed the show! It really helps get us out there 💜
