    <item>
      <title>Saka Punch | Gameweek 14</title>
      <description>This week, it’s a shorter show as the Gameweeks turn over thick and fast!
 
Tom and Sam reflect on the weekend’s events before launching directly into the midweek preview, with captaincy perhaps up for grabs as well as spanners being thrown into the mix affecting our transfer plans. We chat selling Mbeumo, if Jackson is the key man, as well as why Saka is probably a no brainer.
 
Please drop a like and subscribe to the channel if you enjoyed the show!
