    <item>
      <title>Prepping To Cook | Gameweek 13</title>
      <description>This week, Tom &amp; Sam cast their eye over the upcoming, busy fixture run as the first run of midweek games looms between Gameweek 14 &amp; 16, for which the planning starts now!
 
But if we’re going to cook in that period, what do we need to prep to get there? And who should we be targeting as we readjust our sides in the run up to the gameweek congestion.
 
Plus in the Gameweek Preview, a move had already been made in the Kneejerk, there’s bold claims busts and also our thoughts on best captain for the week ahead with many options on the table.
 
Please drop subscribe and maybe even a 5* review if you enjoyed the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
