    <item>
      <title>Correcting Our Mistakes! | FPL Gameweek 12</title>
      <description>With FPL about to hit fast forward, Tom &amp; Sam take a look back to help us in the upcoming onslaught of fixtures by revisiting the 10 mistakes we said we wouldn’t make in preseason to ask – were mistakes made? And, if so, can we learn from this to help guide us to green arrows during the hectic period to follow?
 
Plus in the gameweek preview, our own plans to take big hits come under the microscope, plus best transfers in, captains and bold claims debated!
 
Please drop a subscribe and 5* review if you enjoyed the show!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
