    <item>
      <title>Sharpening The Edges | FPL Gameweek 12</title>
      <description>It’s all about Sam’s favourite term “Edge Pieces” this week, as FPL heads into the final international break of this season and we take our now customary step back to assess the situation.
 
This time, we discuss the importance of the Edge Pieces in FPL – especially this season – and then each pick out and debate a top 3 in defence, midfield and attack that we’re backing (whether they’re in our sides currently or not!) to help guide us to glory when the Premier League returns.
 
We’ll leave the preview ‘til next week!
 
Please drop a subscribe and leave a 5* review if you enjoyed the show.
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
