    <item>
      <title>Going Wild! | FPL Gameweek 11.</title>
      <description>After a punishing weekend for Tom and finally a great one for Sam, there's a few things on the agenda on this week's show!
 
We discuss finally selling Haaland and its aftereffects, whether short term punts could have a place despite our wider plans, and also the increased risk of hits in the new world.
 
Plus our usual gameweek 11 preview!
 
Please drop a subscribe to the channel and 5* review if you enjoyed the show.
