    <item>
      <title>Sort It Out! | FPL Gameweek 10</title>
      <description>After a tumultuous week in FPL – featuring what we’re going to dub a “semi-fail” on Tom’s Haaland TC – and as we head into double figure Gameweek numbers, Tom and Sam chat to try to figure out what’s going wrong this season and how they’re planning to sort it out after a lackluster start to the season!
 
To try to address this, we take a look into the creeping frustration with the template as it has been, and wonder if there’s another way via a very interesting listener question we received last week.
 
Building on that, in our Gameweek ahead preview, we wonder if chucking Haaland out of the team is a good idea as part of the kneejerk, as well as looking into best captains, transfers and there’s been yet another point scored in the Bold Claims!
 
Please subscribe to the pod and leave a 5* review if you enjoyed the show!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
