    <item>
      <title>Triple Time | Gameweek 9</title>
      <description>As FPL resumes after international break, Tom &amp; Sam reflect on a rather disappointing weekend with a packed show looking forward to next week instead!
 
There’s a few things on the running order this week, with a look at whether we are both hitting the button on triple captaining the Norwegian robot, and then as our main focus a look at the defence in FPL: is it worth just divesting entirely after a lot of inconsistency in our backlines?
 
Plus the remainder of the gameweek ahead preview, including the kneejerk, best transfers, bold claims and how our teams are shaping up for the weekend ahead.
 
Please subscribe to the pod and leave a 5* review l if you enjoyed the show!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
