    <item>
      <title>Quad Planning | FPL Gameweek 8</title>
      <description>Title: Quad Planning
 
Tom &amp; Sam zoom back in on the detail on FPL, with the next four fixtures before the final international break of 2024 in focus for this week’s episode.
 
Building on what we began with Nick last week, we look at each team’s performance thus far and ask where our interest lies for FPL, and if – and then, how – we’re looking to be moving in and out any of the players from the 20 sides over the next quad of gameweeks.
 
Plus our GW8 preview returns, including best transfers in and best captain!
 
Please subscribe and maybe give a 5* review if you enjoyed the pod.
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
