    <item>
      <title>Rules Of Engagement | FPL Gameweek 8 (with Nick!)</title>
      <description>Tom &amp; Sam are joined by high-flying former founding co-host Nick to zoom out as we head into the international break.
 
We take time to think about how different levels of engagement in FPL can have their positives and negatives, with Nick enjoying a stellar start to the campaign!
 
We also begin to preview the next block of 4 fixtures in terms of discussing how the key men for the next few weeks may be swapped around by enterprising FPL managers to try to take advantage.
 
Please leave a 5* review and subscribe to us if you enjoyed the show!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
