    <item>
      <title>A Time To Chill | FPL Gameweek 7</title>
      <description>Sam &amp; Tom survey the wreckage after a one man wrecking ball in Cole Palmer torpedoed their Wildcard hopes and dreams!
 
We know not everyone was on Wildcard this week, but a discussion on processing bad weeks and how to react – especially if you have just wildcarded – seems apt given the week we’ve had. Are there any bright spots? Is there anything we’d have done differently?
 
Plus the Gameweek 7 review covers the Kneejerk – buy Palmer pronto? - best captain, bold claims, and best transfers in.
 
Please subscribe to the pod and leave a 5* review if you enjoyed the show!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
