      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Sam &amp; Tom survey the wreckage after a one man wrecking ball in Cole Palmer torpedoed their Wildcard hopes and dreams!</p><p> </p><p>We know not everyone was on Wildcard this week, but a discussion on processing bad weeks and how to react – especially if you have just wildcarded – seems apt given the week we’ve had. Are there any bright spots? Is there anything we’d have done differently?</p><p> </p><p>Plus the Gameweek 7 review covers the Kneejerk – buy Palmer pronto? - best captain, bold claims, and best transfers in.</p><p> </p><p>Please subscribe to the pod and leave a 5* review if you enjoyed the show!</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
