    <item>
      <title>Wildcards Active! | FPL Gameweek 6</title>
      <description>Sam &amp; Tom have both pressed the button this week, meaning hot picks and team structure take centre stage.
 
We know not everyone is on wildcard, so to assist everyone – while using our wildcard drafts as the main discussion springboard – we do an audit of FPL key picks from top to bottom (as reasonably as we possibly can!), noting top individuals for managers to consider, whatever your situation!
 
Plus the Gameweek 6 review covers best captain – dare you zag against the Robot? – bold claims, and best transfers in.
 
Please leave subscribe and leave a 5 star review if you enjoyed the show!
