    <item>
      <title>Game States | FPL Gameweek 5</title>
      <description>Tom &amp; Sam assess the damage after a below par return to FPL action following the international break.

We take a look at the current FPL game state, with a heavily – yet, maybe, temporary – templated player set at the moment meaning differential hauls make all the difference. But, with Gameweek 6 wildcards the popular strategy, we ask: how long will this last? And how should we manage to adapt to the season as it evolves?

Then it’s the price point – an eye test warning, followed by the gameweek 5 preview. This includes the Knee Jerk – time to finally jettison Isak if you haven’t already? – best transfers, best captains and astonishing news as one of us finally puts one away in Bold Claims.

Please do us a massive and subscribe to the pod and leave a 5* review if you enjoyed the show, it goes a long way!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
