    <item>
      <title>Decision Making Analysed | Gameweek 4</title>
      <description>As FPL slowly emerges from its international break slumber, Tom and Sam take time to dwell on decision making and how things may be altered by the format tweaks this year now we’ve had some time with the game live.
 
We investigate how decision-making processes – satisficing vs maximising in behavioural science – are somewhat shaped by our personalities and where it feeds into FPL – and how this has changed now with the new(ish) FPL updates as wildcard season is either here or near for many.
 
Plus in the Gameweek 4 preview, we take a look at the Kneejerk – how are wildcarders looking? – best transfers in, captains and update on bold claims before revealing our GW4 setups.
 
We hope you enjoyed the show! If you did, please subscribe and leave a 5* review!

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
