    <item>
      <title>Midfield Mixed Fortunes | Gameweek 3</title>
      <description>This week, Tom &amp; Sam zoom in on one troublesome spot in our fantasy teams: the expanded funzone midfield at around 5.0-8.5m. With many unhappy owning the likes of Nkunku and Eze, we wonder who, of any of these guys, is worth investment now or keeping an eye on going forward.

There’s the Price Point, where we highlight one bit of eye test info Sam noted this week.

And then it’s the Gameweek 3 preview. In the kneejerk, it’s wildcard discussion: lots were popped yesterday, so what do we think of that and what should they look like? Plus our own kneejerks, where one transfer may have already been made… As usual we finish with best transfers and captains and bold claims.

We hope you enjoyed the show! If you did, please subscribe and leave a 5* review!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
