    <item>
      <title>And We're Off! | Gameweek 2</title>
      <description>Sam and Tom are back after the FPL opening weekend to react to the drama as it unfolded.
 
On this week’s pod, a lot of bits and pieces with scant data to report on:
- Our GW1 reflections: what changes did we make on the final day, how did we do and what have we learned?
- Introducing The Price Point: Sam’s eye test spot for this (and every!) Gameweek
- Gameweek 2 Preview, including the Kneejerk, Best Transfers, Bold Claims and Best Captains
- Transfers and Captains
 
Thanks so much for listening! Please subscribe and leave a 5 star review if you enjoyed the show.
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
