    <item>
      <title>Choose Your Fighter! | WGTA Preseason</title>
      <description>Tom and Sam present their preview of the opening weekend!

FPL preseason has reached boiling point – as the UK has in summer – as we go through our final points ahead of Gameweek 1.

On this week’s pod, it’s the return of Pick Your Fighter as we examine some of the key, outstanding decisions FPL managers are grappling with in several positions in the drafting frenzy ahead of the deadline.

We also lay out our (loose) aims for the season ahead, last minute gameweek 1 advice, and lock in our season long Bold Claims – as well as getting the ball rolling for the weekly ones ahead of the first round of matches– and reveal our (provisional) final drafts in a packed preview pod.

We hope you enjoyed our preseason content! 🔥 

Please like and subscribe to the channel if you liked what you watched 🙏
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
