    <item>
      <title>10 Mistakes To Avoid | WGTA Preseason, FPL 2024-25</title>
      <description>This week, Tom &amp; Sam look into management tips as FPL preseason simmers away.

On today’s pod:
- General discussion of how things are developing – players who are becoming more interesting to us and the wider community and our thoughts
- A very swift draft update – where are we in our thinking?
- And the highlight of this week’s pod, we’ve put our minds together and thought up 10 mistakes we won’t be – HOPEFULLY – making this season in fantasy which we hope will help you, too, as we discuss them

If you enjoyed the show, please subscribe and leave a 5* review!
