    <item>
      <title>Let's Get Analytical (with @Analytic_FPL) | Pre Season, Fantasy Premier League 24-25</title>
      <description>This week, Sam and Tom are spending a bit of time meditating on probably the most significant thing that’s hit FPL in recent years: analytics.

To talk about this, there’s literally no-one better to invite on as a guest than the Dark Lord of Analytics himself, Simon @analytic_FPL.

We cover a myriad of factors surrounding the use of analytics and FPL Review in FPL, trying to answer a central point: is this evolution, or revolution?

Please leave a 5* rating and maybe even a review if you enjoyed the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
