    <item>
      <title>Season Review | WGTA 2023-24</title>
      <description>We said goodbye to FPL 2023/24 in interesting fashion, with one last blast on a final day which had the sting definitively taken out of it football wise BUT a lot to play for in fantasy football.

Today, we provide you with a full season review for the FPL campaign that has been and gone, and start looking ahead to lessons we can take into the new season come August.

THANK YOU SO MUCH FOR YOUR SUPPORT THIS YEAR 💜 
We'll be back in Junetime when the game reopens.
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
