    <item>
      <title>We Made It! | Gameweek 38</title>
      <description>We're back for our penultimate pod of the season, previewing the final gameweek!

We pick over the wreckage of DGW37 first, and then move into our look ahead with the mini league and bold claims in close contention.

Then a focus on the final week itself - asking, historically, how many goals are scored so what does that tell us?
And who should we be buying in per position, and key punts for that final week with Tom in particular needing a miracle to end up in the top 100k.

THANK YOU SO MUCH for your company if this is your final stop this season. We hope we assisted you.

We'll be back next Tuesday for our final pod of the season.

Please leave a 5 star rating and subscribe if you liked this episode 🙏
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
