    <item>
      <title>Time For Heroes... Again! | DGW 37</title>
      <description>What else could we do this week aside from previewing the final, big double of the season in Double Gameweek 37?!

We go through the teams doubling and ask who the "locked in" key men are, and hunt for differential opportunities - both within the doublers, and also in single gameweek teams too.

Plus our bold claims, captaincy decision (surely the robot rules?) and our own plans for the double.

Please leave a like and subscribe if you enjoy the show!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
