    <item>
      <title>Where Are The Edges? | Gameweek 36</title>
      <description>Double gameweek 35 is mostly in the books, and FPL – at least in the engaged end – seems to have taken that Buzz Lightyear meme where there’s hundreds of clones on a shelf to heart, while players are dropping like flies and many manager’s teams are redolent of the walking wounded.

Today, we investigate whether there are in fact any edges left open to us for the final 3 gameweeks of the season, or is it a case of just accepting your lot.

Plus the Gameweek 36 preview, including best transfers in (especially if, like Sam, your team is echoing those walking wounded!) and captaincy.

If you enjoyed the pod, please subscribe and leave a 5 star review!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
