    <item>
      <title>How Much Do We Risk? | Double Gameweek 35</title>
      <description>WGTA return during the second half of double gameweek 34, which was without doubt one of the most swingy weeks we’ve seen for a while, with various permutations in terms of free hit choices and one week punts for those now on wildcards leading to really diverging outcomes here and there 🔀

We discuss possible changes to the game post FA Cup replay scrappage and outcome processing (in brief!) before moving onto discussing how much we risk in terms of the end of the season: Gameweeks are running out, so where do we (either on wildcard 35 or not!) take opportunities to risk it? 🎲

Plus our Gameweek 35 Preview, including bold claims, best transfers in and best captain.

Please do subscribe and leave a 5 star review if you liked the pod, it truly helps us grow 🙏
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
