      <title>Time for Heroes | FPL Double Gameweek 34</title>
      <description>We're back for another full-fat pod after a chaotic GW33 unfolded, leaving us to pick apart the wreckage as usual, especially after some VERY last minute decisions were made by both hosts...

This week, though, it's all about Double Gameweek 34 as we preview it for Non Free Hitters and Free Hitters alike. We look at key transfers in, where the heroes may be, and also single gameweekers you may want to keep on board. Plus decide on the captaincy.

