    <item>
      <title>Against Better Judgement | Gameweek 33</title>
      <description>With the final few double gameweeks of the season all but locked in now, the WGTA crew discuss many of the popular picks possibly exiting our sides in the coming weeks, as managers chase upside. But the key question is, will it prove a wise move to do so?

Plus our Gameweek 33 preview: is there any alternative to the robot for our armbands? And what, depending on your strategies, is the best way to approach transfers?

As always, please leave a 5* review and subscribe if you enjoy the show!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
