      <title>Phil Your Boots | Gameweek 32</title>
      <description>Tom &amp; Sam are back in the middle of the hustle and bustle of three Gameweeks in 7 days with a lightning pod ⚡️ 

With one Foden owner and one Noden, we reflect on how small decisions made a long time ago can make big differences further down the track 🚃 

And then we preview Gameweek 32, with best captains - a lot on offer this week - and top transfers in.

Please remember to subscribe if you enjoyed the show 🙏
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
