    <item>
      <title>Silly Season | Double Gameweek 28</title>
      <description>We’re back as the mist starts to clear and Gameweek 29 strategies start to be solidified, albeit slightly upended by freak injuries and a certain Phil Foden making a major case to be a potential season keeper.

This week, we assess him and a few others in terms of their value vs their listed price – what if FPL was repriced tomorrow, how would they come out? And what does that tell us about FPL assets later in the season?

Plus the options for chip strategising come to a head as DGW28's transfers seemingly rely on how you're approaching navigating the blank week that immediately follows. We discuss those strategies, as well as best transfers and whether you will or you, er, will be captaining Solanke for DGW28.

Leave a like and subscribe if you enjoy the show! 🙏
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
