    <item>
      <title>... Go! (FA Cup Results Live Reaction) | FPL Gameweek 27</title>
      <description>The WGTA boys team up to give their live reaction and hot takes after the FA Cup 5th round concludes, and BGW29 is locked in.

We talk about how the game has now opened up with a whole plethora of different strategies now viable as the "maximum chaos" secnario occurred because the FA Cup remained shock free.

Plus Hwang transfer out chat and if we dare go against Haaland post 5 goal monstrosity.

