    <item>
      <title>Ready...Set... | FPL Gameweek 27 (feat FPL Cim)</title>
      <description>With crucial information to come later this week, the regulat WGTA crew are joined by TikTok star and all-round good bloke FPL Cim to run through the different scenarios we could be about to face, and how we would react to each of them!

In installment one of a two parter this week (we won't be live for the second part as it's during the workday - it'll be at lunchtime, employers! - and we might be in poor locations for audio) we look at the three scenarios FPL managers may encounter due to the FA Cup results as a primer for you to think about how to approach planning from here.

Plus we look at best captain (Saka vs Haaland vs... others!) and best transfers in across positions (again, with the FA Cup results in mind!)

Please leave subscribe to the pod and give a 5* rating if you enjoy the show! 🙏
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
