      <title>Double Jeopardy | Double Gameweek 25</title>
      <description>Tom &amp; Sam are back to offer a (hopefully) measured summary of how best to prepare our FPL teams for the first big double gameweek of the season. Do we pile into as many doublers as possible, or take a more cautious approach with blanks looming...

Plus in the gameweek preview, we look at best captain (er, Haaland), do we triple captain plus data analyse the four doubling teams to ask what the best transfers are for DGW25.

