      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Another testing Gameweek in the WGTA villa, so we sit down to discuss the concept of control in FPL. How much do we really have, what's the behavioural way of looking at it, and how can we contend with this - especially with upcoming double &amp; blank Gameweeks?</p><p><br></p><p>And in our new gameweek preview section, we discuss the week ahead:</p><p>- who's the best captain?</p><p>- who's the best transfer in?</p><p>Before looking at our own teams.</p><p><br></p><p>Please subscribe to the pod if you enjoyed the show! 🙏</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
      </content:encoded>
      <itunes:duration>5389</itunes:duration>
      <guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[921615f4-c47a-11ee-a5a2-7312717da86a]]></guid>
