    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Save Our Seasons! | Gameweek 23</title>
      <description>The WGTA crew have both endured a miserable GW23, so we welcome you on board to have a bit of a laugh at a season that keeps throwing punches our way!

Either empathise or indulge in a bit of schadenfreude as we talk how we're rolling - or not - with the punches this season and how we're looking to zag in the near term to try to arrest the decline.

Plus bold claims update and listener questions

Please subscribe to the pod and leave a 5 star ⭐️ review if you enjoyed the show! 🙏
