    <item>
      <title>New Year, Same Problems | Gameweek 20</title>
      <description>Join us for our final pod of the year as we pick through the rubble of another questionable gameweek in FPL - commiserate if you're also feeling a bit let down by the ol' fantasy, or enjoy the schadenfreude coursing through your veins if you're onto a winner recently.
We discuss aggressive vs cautious approaches to get out of this rut, plus the Salah/Sonundrum heavily in the questions.
HAPPY NEW YEAR FROM WGTA.
Please subscribe and leave a 5* review if you enjoyed the show! 🙏
