      <description>The fixture crunch is upon us as we head towards the busy winter Premier League schedule. With matches coming thick and fast, the WGTA boys decipher how best to navigate the upcoming congested fixture run facing FPL managers, looking at the upcoming fixtures and the key men to bring in.
