    <item>
      <title>State Of Play | Gameweek 13</title>
      <description>After the horror-show of GW11, the WGTA boys were in good spirits after a rejuvenating green arrow for both other their sides, as we head into the third (!) international break of the season.

This week's pod takes a deep look into the underlying data of all 20 Premier League teams so far this season, as we look for key takeaways &amp; insights which we can use to inform our decisions as we move forward.

Subscribe to the pod if you enjoyed the show 🙏!
