    <item>
      <title>Are We Overthinking? | FPL Gameweek 11</title>
      <description>Ahead of Gameweek 11, WGTA takes a deep look into the curious topic of over-management, analysing some of the key behavioural science concepts entrenched in this phenomenon. We aim to focus on how to spot when we are prone to over-managing our FPL teams, and how best to guard against it.
Plus an extensive Q+A
Please leave a 5* review and subscribe to the pod if you enjoyed pray 🙏
