    <item>
      <title>FoMO Rising | Double Gameweek 7</title>
      <description>Sam returns to the pod this week as the WGTA crew debate the effects of FoMO as part of our FPL shared experiences, ahead of our first double gameweek of the season.

Is FOMO in full-force this season, is it necessarily always a negative thing, or could it possibly provide us with some utility as FPL managers? Tune in to find out...

Please leave a like a subscribe to the channel if you enjoy our content! 🙏
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
