    <item>
      <title>Who Do We Trust? | Gameweek 6</title>
      <description>With Sam off sunning himself, Nick's back guesting with a yellow flagged Tom (poked in the eye by a baby) as we speak about how to react to a pretty poor start for many engaged managers: react or be patient?

That brings us on to the most valuable commodity in FPL: trust in our players. With this thin on the ground, what do we do next?

Sam's back next week (sorry for any shoddy segues!)

If you enjoyed the show, please remember to like &amp; subscribe! 🙏
