      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>So we reach the end.</p><p>Tom and Lucy (for her final pod as co-host) are back for the final pod of the season, covering:</p><ul>
<li>Season reviews - how did our campaigns go?</li>
<li>3 reasons why this season was so peculiar</li>
<li>3 predictions for 2023/24</li>
<li>End of season awards</li>
