    <item>
      <title>WGTA S6 E17 - Should We Zombie Our FPL Teams?</title>
      <description>Tom and Lucy are back together after a couple of skeleton service pods to discuss a key issue affecting enervated FPL managers; should we just give up and zombify our FPL teams?
OBVIOUSLY the answer is no, but it's worth a quick delve into things to see if anything could've been done differently after a bruising few weeks.
PLUS in the questions section, we look forward the final 3 weeks prior to the world cup pause - does our playstyle change? And who do we target?
Back next week!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
