    <item>
      <title>WGTA Summer Special - FPL &amp; Behavioural Science/Psychology 2022/23</title>
      <description>In the first of two summer specials this year, Tom is joined once more by Ross (FPL_Raptor) and Simon March (former FPL winner) (and very briefly, Lucy, before internet issues kicked in) to discuss the relationship between FPL, psychology and behavioural science.Following on from last year's approach zooming in on one Gameweek, this time we zoom out and discuss what cognitive impacts could afflict managers throughout an entire season.A super enjoyable pod to record. 
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
