    <item>
      <title>WGTA S6E1 - What do we think about the season ahead?</title>
      <description>WGTA is back for another season! This year, Tom's joined by Lucy - a top manager who will nicely counterweight the perpetual disappointment that is his FPL life on WGTA :)For our opening pod of the campaign, we introduce ourselves a bit, and then have a macro discussion on how we think the season may shape out given what we know at this point and how FPL manager's strategies may look as we go forward.It's great to be back, looking forward to season 6 (SIX!) of WGTA.
