    <item>
      <title>WGTA S5 E20   How do we navigate this uncertain time in FPL? (with FPL General)</title>
      <description>This week, Tom and Anthony are joined by FPL General to garner his pearls of wisdom on what are the strangest of times in fantasy football and ask how indeed do we navigate this most uncertain of times?Elsewhere, it's cheeky pens in the correspondence and the gamut of context-appropriate FPL related questions in the Q&amp;A.One final week for the mini-league, which will be locked after GW19: 2ip43t.We wish you a merry and healthy Christmas. Back sometime before this calendar year is out. Probably.
